  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass ' $m$ ' moves in one dimension under the action of a conservative force whose potential energy has the form of $U(x)=-\\frac{\\alpha x}{x^2+\\beta^2}$ where $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ are dimensional parameters. The angular frequency of the oscillation is proportional to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Fe0w2",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{\\alpha^3}{m \\beta^4}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
