      "text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{\\alpha}{m \\beta^4}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "CLPJY",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{\\alpha}{m \\beta^3}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Y2VJs",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{\\alpha}{m \\beta^6}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text { Hint: } U & =-\\frac{\\alpha x}{x^2+\\beta^2} \\\\\n\\text { here, }[\\beta] & =[L] \\\\\n{[\\alpha] } & =\\left[M^3 T^{-2}\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nonly option (C) has dimension of $\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{~T}}$",
